{
  "id": "E087",
  "title": "Running or Shopping",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-02-08",
  "synopsis": "If you want to make your boyfriend do exercise we have the trick for you.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/336/c336eee4e25b34f279626ecc989ca38f63c796dd.mp3?1486413760",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "跑步还是逛街\n\n林红：晚上你打算做什么？\n王力：不知道，你呢？\n林红：我们去跑步吧!\n王力：跑步啊……我不太喜欢跑步 。\n林红：那我们去逛街吧，我想买一双新跑鞋。\n王力：逛街啊……那我们还是去跑步吧。今天天气这么好，最适合跑步了。",
    "traditional": "跑步還是逛街\n\n林紅：晚上你打算做什麼？\n王力：不知道，你呢？\n林紅：我們去跑步吧!\n王力：跑步啊……我不太喜歡跑步 。\n林紅：那我們去逛街吧，我想買一雙新跑鞋。\n王力：逛街啊……那我們還是去跑步吧。今天天氣這麼好，最適合跑步了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Running or shopping"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "林红：晚上你打算做什么？",
      "traditional": "林紅：晚上你打算做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǎn shang nǐ dǎ suàn zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: What do you plan to do this evening?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "王力：不知道，你呢？",
      "traditional": "王力：不知道，你呢？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì bù zhī dào nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: I don’t know. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "林红：我们去跑步吧!",
      "traditional": "林紅：我們去跑步吧!",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ men qù pǎo bù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Let’s go running!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王力：跑步啊……我不太喜欢跑步 。",
      "traditional": "王力：跑步啊……我不太喜歡跑步 。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì pǎo bù a wǒ bú tài xǐ huan pǎo bù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Running…I don’t like running."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "林红：那我们去逛街吧，我想买一双新跑鞋。",
      "traditional": "林紅：那我們去逛街吧，我想買一雙新跑鞋。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng nà wǒ men qù guàng jiē ba wǒ xiǎng mǎi yì shuāng xīn pǎo xié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: How about shopping? I want to buy a pair of new running shoes."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王力：逛街啊……那我们还是去跑步吧。今天天气这么好，最适合跑步了。",
      "traditional": "王力：逛街啊……那我們還是去跑步吧。今天天氣這麼好，最適合跑步了。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì guàng jiē a nà wǒ men hái shi qù pǎo bù ba jīn tiān tiān qì zhè me hǎo zuì shì hé pǎo bù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Shopping… then let’s go running. The weather is really good today, perfect for running."
    }
  ],
